Baʼii barreessi: (['a:b:'] - [':']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['-'] - ['--']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ([''] - ['--']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['--'] - ['']), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ([''] - ['']), dhaabi.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Baʼii barreessi: x, dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: y, dhaabi.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x bakka-buusi: [''] tiin: ['xx'].
Baʼii barreessi: ((x isuma-tokko: y) tokkoykn: ['OK'] ykn: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), dhaabi.